<p>The American gentlewoman described is <a href="http://scp-wiki.net/SCP-1856">SCP-1856</a> when alive. It is strongly implied that she plays a role in the events leading to <a href="http://scp-wiki.net/SCP-2084">SCP-2084</a>, hence the &quot;Anabasis&quot; reference which serves no real purpose other than be a stinger that apparently worked.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<p>Rumetzen is right, though, this is pretty heavily dependent on the SCPs it's based off but that's no excuse to hate it =D</p>

