<p>This is very well written, and it seems (to me anyway) that you've done a decent amount of background research to give this an air of historicity.</p>
<p>It's also a fragment. I don't mind it being dependent on the skips to a certain extent, since all of the entries are dependent on those to a certain extent and that is indeed the point here. But it does need to be a little something more; right now, it's essentially an addendum to another article, not an article in its own right.</p>

